# ACME WIDGETS INC.

{% center %}**Unanimous Written Consent of the Board of Directors**{% /center %}

The undersigned, being all of the directors of Acme Widgets Inc., a Delaware corporation (the **"Company"**), adopt the following resolutions by written consent effective as of {% fill %}Effective Date{% /fill %}.

## Approval of the Widget Plan

1. RESOLVED, that the Widget Plan in the form presented to the Board is *approved and adopted*.
   1. The Widget Plan reserves {% fill %}Number{% /fill %} shares of Common Stock for issuance.
   1. The officers may amend the Widget Plan to correct {% fill %}scrivener's errors {% fill %}and omissions{% /fill %}{% /fill %}.

## Issuance of Shares

2. RESOLVED, that the Company issue shares of Common Stock to the persons listed below:

{% table widths="40,30,30" %}
* Holder
* Shares
* Price per share
---
* {% fill %}Holder One{% /fill %}
* 1,000
* $0.001
---
* {% fill %}Holder Two{% /fill %}
* 2,500
* $0.001
{% /table %}

> The officers may execute any certificate, instrument or notice described in these resolutions.

## General Authority

3. RESOLVED, that each officer is authorized to take any action necessary to carry out these resolutions.\
   This consent may be signed in counterparts.

